      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Complete the text, using the words given. You may make any changes to the words if necessary.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 98px; border-color: #2dc26b; border-style: dashed;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"5\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33.4277%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>roll</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.4277%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>adjust</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2872%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>technology</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33.4277%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>device</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.4277%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>button</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2872%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>smartphone</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>In the future, <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.1</label><input id='fbo-901920-0' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='0' name='fbo-901920-0' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901920-0' /></span></strong> will completely change the way people communicate. Smart <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.2</label><input id='fbo-901920-1' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='1' name='fbo-901920-1' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901920-1' /></span></strong> will have voice-controlled systems, so people will only need to speak to give commands. The systems will understand and do tasks automatically.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Future <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.3</label><input id='fbo-901920-2' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='2' name='fbo-901920-2' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901920-2' /></span></strong> will have flexible screens that people can <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.4</label><input id='fbo-901920-3' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='3' name='fbo-901920-3' type='text' size='5' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901920-3' /></span></strong> to make them smaller and easier to carry like small papers. They also will not need<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.5</label><input id='fbo-901920-4' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='4' name='fbo-901920-4' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901920-4' /></span></strong>, as users will control everything with voice commands or gestures.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Meetings and conversations will also change. Smart assistants will <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.6</label><input id='fbo-901920-5' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='5' name='fbo-901920-5' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901920-5' /></span></strong> volume, screen brightness, or language settings automatically. Communication therefore will be smoother, which helps people stay focused without worrying about small details.</p>",
